{"name":"Bonanza","hex":"#523b2c","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Bonanza","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A city in Klamath County, Oregon, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Bonanza"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bonanza","blocks":[{"text":"Bonanza is an American Western television series that ran on NBC from September 12, 1959, to January 16, 1973. Lasting 14 seasons and 431 episodes, Bonanza is NBC's longest-running Western, the second-longest-running Western series on American network television, and one of the longest-running, live-action American series. The show continues to air in syndication. The show is set in the 1860s and centers on the wealthy Cartwright family, who live in the vicinity of Virginia City, Nevada, bordering Lake Tahoe. The series initially starred Lorne Greene, Pernell Roberts, Dan Blocker and Michael Landon and later featured Guy Williams, David Canary, Mitch Vogel and Tim Matheson. The show is known for presenting pressing moral dilemmas."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f1/Bonanza_title_screen.jpg/330px-Bonanza_title_screen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bonanza"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Bonanza-Ponderosa_Ranch-postcard-03_%285619566355%29.jpg/500px-Bonanza-Ponderosa_Ranch-postcard-03_%285619566355%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Bonanza-Ponderosa_Ranch-postcard-03_%285619566355%29.jpg/500px-Bonanza-Ponderosa_Ranch-postcard-03_%285619566355%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Ponderosa tour postcard – visitors tour the replica ranchhouse and its big living room with stone fireplace overlooking the east shore of Lake Tahoe, in Incline Village, Nevada where several rebuilt ranch buildings were used as a set for outside filming.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABonanza-Ponderosa_Ranch-postcard-03_(5619566355).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Bonanza_main_cast_1961.JPG/500px-Bonanza_main_cast_1961.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Bonanza_main_cast_1961.JPG/500px-Bonanza_main_cast_1961.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Pernell Roberts, Dan Blocker, Lorne Greene and Michael Landon (1961)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABonanza_main_cast_1961.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Bonanza_full_cast_1962.JPG/500px-Bonanza_full_cast_1962.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Bonanza_full_cast_1962.JPG/500px-Bonanza_full_cast_1962.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Front to back: Pernell Roberts, Michael Landon, Dan Blocker and Lorne Greene","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABonanza_full_cast_1962.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/Philip_Ahn.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/Philip_Ahn.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Philip Ahn in \"The Fear Merchants\"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APhilip_Ahn.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Lorne_Greene_Ben_Cartwright_Bonanza.JPG/500px-Lorne_Greene_Ben_Cartwright_Bonanza.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Lo